      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry property consultants Drogheda are delighted to bring to this very well presented, 3 bedroom property onto the market in excellent walk in condition.  The property is located only minutes from Drogheda town centre.  Close to all local amenities including primary and secondary schools, shops, restaurants, chemists, doctor's surgeries and shopping centres. The property is only 25 minutes from Dublin airport and Dublin city centre.  Accommodation consists of sitting room, kitchen/ dining room, WC, 3 bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\n# Schools walking distance 10 mins \r\n# St. Mary's 2 mins\r\n# Sacred heart\r\n\r\n# Close to Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital\r\n\r\n# Duleek 10 mins drive\r\n# Ashbourne 15 mins \r\n\r\n# Beach's within driving distance\r\n# Golf clubs within driving distance"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation Details: Halpins Terrace, Platin Road, Drogheda, Co. Louth.  \r\n\r\nPorch:\t\t\t1.7m x 0.7m\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\t2.5m x 1m + 1.8m x 1m  \r\nWooden Flooring, Wall panelling, Carpet stairwell.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: \t6.9m x 3.4m\r\n\t\t\tWooden flooring, fireplace, double doors leading to dining area.\r\n\r\nDining Area:\t\t3.2m x 2.6m\r\n\t\t\tTiled flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen:\t4.10m x 3.3m + 2.8m x 1.3m \r\nTiled floor, fitted units, and tiled splashback, integrated appliances, Kitchen Island, door leading to the back garden.\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC:\t2.3m x 1.7m \r\nWC, WHB, bath with overhead Shower, tiled walls & flooring. \r\n\r\nLanding: \t\t4.23m x 1.8m \r\nWall panelling, fully carpeted, hot press.\r\n \r\nBedroom 1: \t\t3.7m x 2.4m\r\nCarpet flooring, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t2.7m x 2.44m\r\nWooden flooring, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\t\t4.84m x 3.3m\r\nCarpet flooring, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nEn-suite:\t \t3.3m x 1.4m\r\nWC, WHB, Shower, Tiled.\r\n\r\nGarden:\t\tDecking area to rear, spacious garden, lawn, side entrance to back garden.  \r\nack garden."
      },
